{"id":"wb-3-82","name":"北京孔庙","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"北京孔庙","text":"北京孔庙位于中华人民共和国北京市东城区安定门内国子监街，是仅次于山东曲阜孔庙的中国第二大孔庙，始建于元大德六年（1302年），是元明清三代中央政府官方祭祀孔子的场所，除了三代皇帝，袁世凯在自封为中华帝国皇帝之后也曾前往北京孔庙祭孔。\n孔庙占地约2万平方米，有四进院落。分布于中轴线上的建筑从自南向北顺次为先师门、大成门、大成殿、崇圣祠。孔庙内收藏有自元以来各代科举进士题名碑、乾隆年间仿制的西周石鼓以及由江苏金坛贡生蒋衡手书的十三经碑林189块。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E5%8C%97%E4%BA%AC%E5%AD%94%E5%BA%99","revisionId":94082293,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=94082293","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与所在地一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/de761b44460ff1948ca8c7f5.jpg","title":"BeijingConfuciusTemple2.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:BeijingConfuciusTemple2.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/0/04/BeijingConfuciusTemple2.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"LuxTonnerre","license":"CC BY 2.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/2.0","caption":"The Confucius Temple of Beijing","width":320,"height":213}}